
enable_stage_logging is being passed to a module input that does not exist in the module version at:

git::https://github.com/kfbmic/tf-module-api-gateway.git?ref=feature/T012SP/CPE-178

In OpenTofu/Terraform, module calls are strict: unknown inputs fail with exactly this error.

What to check
Open that module’s variables.tf at the same ref.
Confirm the exact input name (it may be different, e.g. renamed).
Either:
rename to the supported variable name, or
remove it, or
update module ref to a version that supports it.
